 },
 "rig": {
  "name": "Buddy_Rig_Mixamo65",
  "bones": 65,
  "axes": "FBX -Z forward, Y up (as the NPC types)",
  "fbx_clip": "Idle only, like the NPC types; the game plays the shared clips (Animations/clips.json roles)"
 },
 "lod_naming": "<mesh>_LOD0 / _LOD1 / _LOD2 (Unity LOD import convention). Toggle all three LODs of an option together. Suggested LODGroup screen heights as the NPC crowd: LOD0 > 0.10, LOD1 > 0.037, LOD2 > 0.01.",
 "unity_notes": [
  "Both FBX files carry the same rig with the same bone names and rest pose: either rebind the parts' SkinnedMeshRenderer.bones to the base skeleton by bone name, or instance the parts FBX under the same Animator.",
  "Colours are material tints: one material per slot shared by every option of an aspect (PLAYER_Top_Main / _Trim / _Accent, PLAYER_Bottom_Main / _Trim / _Accent); set them per renderer (MaterialPropertyBlock or material instance) from the swatch.",
  "Skin: tint Buddy_Skin, Buddy_Skin_Nose, Buddy_Skin_Inner and Buddy_Eye_Rim from the skin tone (Body_* regions and Face).",
  "Face blend shapes as the NPCs: Blink, Blink_L, Blink_R, Surprised, Worried, Happy (GreyboxFace).",
  "Hair, beards and headwear are rigid on mixamorig:Head; nothing is a Props_*Hand mesh (NpcHeldProps must not touch the player)."
 ],
